'''Klinklang''' (Japanese: '''ギギギアル''' ''Gigigiaru'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

