==Trivia==
[[Akira Komayama]] illustrated {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Klink|88}}, {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Klang|89}}, and {{TCG ID|Emerging Powers|Klinklang|76}} cards for the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]; though the cards did not release together in the TCG, their illustrations were later included alongside each other in Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket's {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Emerging Powers|Klinklang|76}} from the {{TCG|Emerging Powers}} expansion.
*'''Gear Spinner''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Steam Siege|Klinklang|73}} from the {{TCG|Steam Siege}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

